WEBVTT

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:03.216
but it is one filled
with more freedom, adventure and love

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:06.176
than I could have ever possibly imagined.

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:08.736
One year after returning home
from our trip,

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:11.736
marriage equality came to California.

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:15.520
And in the end, we believe,
love will win out.

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:21.416
(Video) By the power vested in me,

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:24.016
by the state of California

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:26.296
and by God Almighty,

00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:29.656
I now pronounce you spouses for life.

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:30.896
You may kiss.